{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/bfa06d8074c89c60ea3aa7dee30b4ab2.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/bfa06d8074c89c60ea3aa7dee30b4ab2.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/bfa06d8074c89c60ea3aa7dee30b4ab2.mp4?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Buffet Knight, a tiny hero with a big appetite in this hungry action adventure. Disaster strikes as the Demon Chef steals all the food from Gourmet Kingdom, and it is up to you to save the culinary world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse and colourful world spanning from the lush vegetable forests to the lofty cotton candy clouds. Delve into puzzling dungeons, battle monsters, find treasures and discover secrets! Gobble up everything around you, but will your appetite be satisfied as the connoisseur of all that is delicious?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/30c7f9cf6637aa17c46b95d521ad7796.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/30c7f9cf6637aa17c46b95d521ad7796.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thanks for the Meal!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swallow food, objects, and even your fallen foes to fuel your attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/835785a539a2772c265878c061d51b40.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/835785a539a2772c265878c061d51b40.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/835785a539a2772c265878c061d51b40.mp4?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve challenging puzzles in a variety of unique dungeons.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Get creative, experiment with your abilities and manipulate your surroundings to forge a path!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/f64252c7645269ffe8db65d5982ed4cd.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/f64252c7645269ffe8db65d5982ed4cd.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/f64252c7645269ffe8db65d5982ed4cd.mp4?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Earn New Abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover skills to aid in both combat and exploration!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/c13088f0dc9fd2236524820ab6907c10.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=2