9.jpg?t=1759165906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3410360,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Buffet Knight\u2019s skills are put to the test in the Golden Potluck content update!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/95703e5d520aa06196f562e6a2f62201.avif?t=1759165906\" width=1170 height=379 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hear the sound of shuffling cards, rolling dice, and jingling coins?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffet Knight\u2019s skills are on the table, his fortune tested in the Golden Potluck content update!</p></p><br><h1>Buffet Knight - Decadent Full Course + Original Soundtrack</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/c1be3fe46f893185e680b6e13b5fbe88.avif?t=1759165906\" width=616 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buffet Knight - Decadent Full Course + Original Soundtrack Bundle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full meal combo including a main course of Buffet Knight\u2019s adventure along with a side dish of the original soundtrack!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This bundle contains:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffet Knight - Decadent Full Course Game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffet Knight - Decadent Full Course Soundtrack</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Buffet Knight - Decadent Full Course Demo</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/dc359e68f7c07ca3efb02a8e6df3ac96.avif?t=1759165906\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Have a taste of Buffet Knight\u2019s adventure in this demo appetiser, featuring up to the end of the first dungeon. Transfer your progress into the full game!</strong></i></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/bfa06d8074c89c60ea3aa7dee30b4ab2.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/bfa06d8074c89c60ea3aa7dee30b4ab2.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/bfa06d8074c89c60ea3aa7dee30b4ab2.mp4?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Buffet Knight, a tiny hero with a big appetite in this hungry action adventure. Disaster strikes as the Demon Chef steals all the food from Gourmet Kingdom, and it is up to you to save the culinary world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a diverse and colourful world spanning from the lush vegetable forests to the lofty cotton candy clouds. Delve into puzzling dungeons, battle monsters, find treasures and discover secrets! Gobble up everything around you, but will your appetite be satisfied as the connoisseur of all that is delicious?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/30c7f9cf6637aa17c46b95d521ad7796.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/30c7f9cf6637aa17c46b95d521ad7796.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thanks for the Meal!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swallow food, objects, and even your fallen foes to fuel your attacks!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/835785a539a2772c265878c061d51b40.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/835785a539a2772c265878c061d51b40.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/835785a539a2772c265878c061d51b40.mp4?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve challenging puzzles in a variety of unique dungeons.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Get creative, experiment with your abilities and manipulate your surroundings to forge a path!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/f64252c7645269ffe8db65d5982ed4cd.poster.avif?t=1759165906\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/f64252c7645269ffe8db65d5982ed4cd.webm?t=1759165906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072480/extras/f64252c7645269ffe8